{title: Dil Hoon Hoon Kare}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar Bhupen Hazarika}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Dil hoom hoom kare, [C]ghabraaye
[Am]Ghan dham [C]dham kare, [Am]darr jaaye
[Am]Ek boond [G]kabhi paani [C]ki mori [Am]ankhiyon se barsaaye
[Am]Dil hoom hoom kare, [C]ghabraaye
[C]Teri [Am]jhori daaroon [C]sab [G]sukhe paat [Am]jo aaye
[C]Tera [Am]chhua [C]laage, [Am]meri [G]sukhi [Am]daar hariyaaye
[Am]Dil [C]hoom hoom [Am]kare, ghabraaye
[C]Jis tan ko [Am]chhua tune, us [C]tan ko chhupaaoon
[C]Jis man [Am]ko laage naina, [C]voh kisko dikhaaoon
[C]O [Am]more [C]chandrama, teri [G]chaandni [Am]ang jalaaye
[C]Teri [Am]oonchi [C]ataari [Am]maine [G]pankh [Am]liye katwaaye
